sequenceDiagram
    %% SD4 - Review and grade submissions
    %% Stories: 25, 37, 39, 40, 41
    %% Description: A teacher sees a student's answers and progress in a module, grades submissions automatically or by hand, and sees last year's average grade.
    actor TP as Teacher (person)
    participant DM as DigitalLearningModule
    participant QU as Question
    participant AN as Answer
    participant SU as Submission
    participant GR as Grade
    participant TE as Teacher
    participant CL as Class
    participant ST as Student

    %% covers 39, 41
    TP->>DM: see a student's answers and progress
    DM->>QU: questions
    QU->>AN: answers
    %% covers 25, 37
    TP->>SU: grade automatically or by hand
    SU->>GR: grade
    %% covers 40
    TP->>TE: see last year's average grade
    TE->>CL: classes
    CL->>ST: students
